#: ../../ml/regression_and_estimation.rst:2
msgid "回帰モデルと点推定"
msgstr "Regression Models and Point Estimation"

#: ../../ml/regression_and_estimation.rst:4
msgid "線形回帰の問題を定式化し、最尤推定・MAP推定が最小二乗法・正則化最小二乗法にどう対応するかを見ます。"
msgstr ""
"We formulate the linear regression problem and show how maximum "
"likelihood estimation and MAP estimation correspond to least squares and "
"regularized least squares, respectively."

